DESCRIPTION:Times: 10:10am\, 1pm\, 3:50pm\, 6:40pm\, 9:25pm\nFrom Focus Fea
 tures and Working Title comes an irresistible new take on Jane Austen’s 
 iconic Sense and Sensibility: a charming\, witty\, and deeply relatable st
 ory of love and sisterhood starring Daisy Edgar-Jones and Esmé Creed-Mile
 s.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/sense-and-sensibility/HO00001777\
 nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
