UID:1519a2df0c547d73c43eb71b4f7b413aa53f2c9f@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261017T154538Z
DTSTART:20261017T142000Z
DTEND:20261017T162000Z
SUMMARY:Whalefall
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 10:20am\, 12:45pm\, 3:10pm\, 5:30pm\, 7:50pm\, 10:20pm\n
 A scuba diver in search of his deceased father's remains gets swallowed by
  an 80-foot\, 60-ton sperm whale and has only one hour to escape before hi
 s oxygen runs out. After giving up on life\, the young man is surprised to
  find a reason to live in the most dangerous and unlikely of places.\nhttp
 s://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/whalefall/HO00001774\nFrom Pushpin Wester
 n Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/whalefall/HO00001774
END:VEVENT
