DESCRIPTION:Times: 9am\, 11:25am\, 1:55pm\, 4:30pm\, 7pm\, 9:35pm\nAdapted 
 from Colleen Hoover's best-selling novel\, this seductive\, psychological 
 thriller follows renowned author Verity Crawford (Anne Hathaway) and Lowen
  Ashleigh (Dakota Johnson)\, a struggling writer who relocates to the remo
 te Crawford estate to ghostwrite for Verity. After Lowen uncovers what app
 ears to be Verity's chilling autobiographical notes\, she wrestles with th
 e disturbing and twisted confessions about Verity’s husband Jeremy (Josh
  Hartnett)\, and finds it hard to separate fiction from reality\, manipula
 tion from attraction\, and opportunity from obsession.\nhttps://www.phoeni
 xmovies.net/movies/verity/HO00001763\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://p
 ushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/verity/HO00001763
